		"description": "<p>Your understanding of your religion&rsquo;s teachings has reached new depths, strengthening your ability to bring the power of the divine to bear. &nbsp;You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>You gain an additional specialty with religion, and the maximum size for an expertise die on religion checks for you is 1d10.</li><li>You gain an additional @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.zezsezm2e0azb3ty]{Empowered Turning} effect. &nbsp;If you attempt to use channel divinity to turn undead and one or more creatures succeed on the save, you may use your reaction to make a religion check. &nbsp;You may replace your normal turning DC with the result of the check.</li></ul>",
